<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Access a popup emoji picker with 300+ Unicode emojis organized in 8 categories."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_heart}>{dgettext("help_features", "Opening the Picker")}</.help_h4>
<p>{dgettext("help_features", "Click the smiley face button in the formatting toolbar.")}</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_folder}>{dgettext("help_features", "Categories")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Smileys & Emotion, People & Body, Animals & Nature, Food & Drink, Travel & Places, Activities, Objects, Symbols."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_btn_search}>{dgettext("help_features", "Search")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Type in the search box to filter emojis by name or keyword (minimum 2 characters)."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_btn_add}>{dgettext("help_features", "Inserting")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Click an emoji to insert it at the cursor position in the chat input. The picker closes automatically after selection."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_close}>{dgettext("help_features", "Closing")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext("help_features", "Click outside the picker, press")} <kbd>{dgettext("help_features", "Escape")}</kbd>{dgettext(
    "help_features",
    ", or click the close button."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_terminal}>{dgettext("help_features", "Step by Step")}</.help_h4>
<ol>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_features",
      "Click the Emoji Picker button in the formatting toolbar, next to the chat input."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_features",
      "Pick a category tab, or type at least two letters in the Search emoji box."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_features",
      "Point at an emoji to preview it in the bar at the bottom of the picker."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>{dgettext("help_features", "Click the emoji. It is added where your cursor is.")}</li>
  <li>
    {dgettext("help_features", "Press %{key} to send the message as usual.", key: "Enter")}
  </li>
</ol>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_btn_search}>{dgettext("help_features", "Search Tips")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Search looks at each emoji's name and keywords, in English and in your chosen language. While a search is active, the results replace the category grid. Clear the box or pick a category tab to go back."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_fmt_emoji}>{dgettext("help_features", "This Server's Emoji")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "If the server has its own emoji, they appear first, under the heading This server. Clicking one inserts its name between colons, for example %{example}. The chat shows the picture when the message is displayed.",
    example: ":party:"
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_heart}>{dgettext("help_features", "Reacting With an Emoji")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "The same picker opens when you choose React... in a message's context menu. In that case the emoji you pick is added as a reaction to the message, not to your input."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_link}>{dgettext("help_features", "See Also")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <.help_link topic="feature-reactions">
    {dgettext("help_features", "Reacting to a Message")}
  </.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="feature-server-emoji">
    {dgettext("help_features", "Server Emoji")}
  </.help_link>
</p>
